    "Sync now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sincronizar ahora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address has no valid sign-in code. Try connecting again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa dirección no tiene un código válido. Vuelve a intentar conectar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Health app only gets weight, body fat and lean mass from Withings. Connecting your account adds muscle mass, body water, bone mass, visceral fat, basal metabolism and metabolic age." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La app Salud solo recibe de Withings el peso, la grasa corporal y la masa magra. Si conectas tu cuenta, se añaden la masa muscular, el agua corporal, la masa ósea, la grasa visceral, el metabolismo basal y la edad metabólica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app then downloads your measurements from Withings' servers with your own key. It only reads, it uploads nothing about you, and the key stays on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La app descarga entonces tus medidas de los servidores de Withings con tu propia clave. Solo lee, no sube nada sobre ti y la clave se queda en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The figure follows your trend, not single weigh-ins. Fat widens the waist and belly, and muscle the shoulders, arms and legs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La figura sigue tu tendencia, no cada pesada. La grasa ensancha la cintura y la barriga, y el músculo los hombros, los brazos y las piernas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The outline is your body then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El contorno es tu cuerpo de entonces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trend" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tendencia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very low" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muy baja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visceral fat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grasa visceral"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weigh yourself on a smart scale such as Withings. Its weight, body fat and lean mass reach the Health app, and this tab turns them into trends and a 3D model. Connect your Withings account to add muscle, water, bone and visceral fat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pésate en una báscula inteligente como Withings. Su peso, grasa corporal y masa magra llegan a la app Salud, y esta pestaña los convierte en tendencias y en un modelo 3D. Conecta tu cuenta de Withings para añadir músculo, agua, hueso y grasa visceral."
          }
        }
      }
    },
